  title="Making Your Own Measuring Tools - DES4800"
  description="Design and fabricate custom measuring tools for product design studio work."
>
  <article class="post-detail">
    <header class="post-header">
      <a href="/making-your-own-tools/" class="back-link">← Back to Making Your Own Tools</a>
      <h1>Making Your Own Measuring Tools</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        In this mini-project you will design and make measuring tools you will use in your product design studio work.
        You'll make guides, fixtures, and aids that help you mark, check, and cut more accurately.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
